# Working material that is not the product: the supplied design reference,
# agent/skill caches, and screenshots dropped in the project root. A stray
# `git add -A` once swept an 78MB video into a commit; this is the guard.
Design-reference.mov
Screenshot*.png
.agents/
.claude/skills/
.github/copilot-instructions/
skills-lock.json

# Local render previews — see scripts/preview-kit.ts
.preview/

# Impeccable's live session state — pids, ports and heartbeat timestamps for a
# question server that is running on one machine. The rest of `.impeccable/` is
# tracked on purpose: the config, the design sidecar and the critique snapshots
# are the record of how a decision was reached.
.impeccable/questions/
